				<text><![CDATA[APF-As per Formula
ANS-Average of next spam
TBM-Total break down of meter
THM-Theft of meter
MUM-Meter under Maintainence
TPM-Tampering of meter
AVG-Rverage Of Meter Reading
NAM-No Access to Meter
IFM-Inproper Fuctioning of Meter
NOG-No Gap
ADS-Average of Previous Span
TBM2-Double Consumption
A3MN-Average of Previous 3 Months
THM2-THeft of Meter [A3MN+Ntr Cost]
THM3-THeft of Meter [TBM1+Mtr Cost]]]></text>
			</staticText>
